  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>65</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lí Cô-sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>450</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>630</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>450</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>630</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>65</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>359775</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>359775</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>672</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>Vậy hai máy bay cách nhau khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>599</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.",
